    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Our address",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>ZOLLER Inc.<br/>3900 Research Park Drive<br/>Ann Arbor, MI 48108</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.google.de/maps/dir//Zoller+Inc.,+3900+Research+Park+Dr,+Ann+Arbor,+MI+48108,+Vereinigte+Staaten/@42.2351206,-83.8031319,12z/data=!4m8!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x883caff23c528fd5:0xc1e8e30653f327c4!2m2!1d-83.7335066!2d42.2351325\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Route in Google Maps</a></p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c4934",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "From the airport",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The closest airport to ZOLLER Inc. is the Detroit Metropolitan Wayne County Airport (DTW), which is located about 30 minutes from our North American headquarters.</p> <p>We can arrange transportation to and from our facility to make your trip as smooth and efficient as possible.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.metroairport.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>DTW website</strong></a></p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c7344",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Hotel",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>We have room blocks available at Residence Inn by Marriott Ann Arbor South and Staybridge Hotel &amp; Suites - Univ of Michigan. These blocks are accessible through the links below. </p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.marriott.com/event-reservations/reservation-link.mi?id=1770741087521&amp;key=GRP&amp;app=resvlink&amp;_branch_match_id=1550870462103671470&amp;_branch_referrer=H4sIAAAAAAAAA8soKSkottLXTywo0MtNLCrKzC8p0UvOz9UvSi3OyczLtgdK2ALZZSCOWmaKraG5uYG5iaGBhbmpkaFadmqlrXtQgFpdUWpaKlB3Xnp8UlF%2BeXFqka1zRlF%2BbioApPnkUWAAAAA%3D\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Book now – Residence Inn</strong></a> </p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.ihg.com/redirect?path=asearch&amp;brandCode=SB&amp;localeCode=en®ionCode=1&amp;hotelCode=arbsb&amp;checkInDate=12&amp;checkInMonthYear=042026&amp;checkOutDate=15&amp;checkOutMonthYear=042026&amp;rateCode=6CBARC&amp;_PMID=99801505&amp;GPC=ZTD&amp;cn=no&amp;adjustMonth=false&amp;showApp=true&amp;monthIndex=00\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Book now - Staybridge Hotel &amp; Suites</strong></a></p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c7348",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Ann Arbor",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Ann Arbor offers both big city attractions and natural areas with scenic trails to explore. We are happy to build out a social program for spouses/partners during the open house event! Email <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"mailto:marketing@zoller-usa.com\"><strong>marketing@zoller-usa.com</strong></a> to arrange!</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.annarbor.org/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Tourist info</strong></a></p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c7352",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
